      "details": "<p class=\"p1\"><em>Teb\u016bk</em>: It is in the desert of\u00a0<em>\u015e\u0101m</em> (Syria), towards\u00a0<em>A\u1e63\u1e25\u0101b-\u0131 Eyke</em> and\u00a0<em>\u015eu\u2018ayb \u2018aleyhi\u2019s-sel\u0101m</em>, one of the citizens, was sent there as a prophet.\u00a0In sum, it lies opposite <em>Medyen</em>. (translated by the creator of the name entry.)</p>",
